  "scope_notes": [
    "The full seven-crate suite, workspace compilation, seven-crate Clippy and rustdoc/glossary preceded the final private Snappy arithmetic/reservation and direct-output repairs.",
    "The final repair reruns both substrate crates including integration tests/doctests and warnings-denied Clippy; no API or consumer changed after the full suite.",
